      "score": 236,
      "comments": 173,
      "author": "gavinhking",
      "published": "2026-08-12T14:02:46Z",
      "bullets": [
        "Attackers are spoofing AI crawler identities like Anthropic’s ClaudeBot to evade firewalls and perform mass vulnerability scanning on web servers.",
        "Simple User-Agent allowlists and robots.txt fail to stop malicious scans; teams must enforce published IP range verification and reverse DNS checks.",
        "Unverified AI bot traffic poses data scraping and exploit risks, requiring security teams to apply strict behavior-based WAF rate limits."
      ]
    },
