      "published": "2026-08-12T12:59:17Z",
      "bullets": [
        "Prioritize upfront domain modeling and explicit system architecture over hasty implementation to prevent technical debt and refactoring churn.",
        "Write self-documenting code with explicit abstractions, error handling, and minimal third-party dependencies to reduce cognitive overhead.",
        "Optimize developer workflows and code reviews around asynchronous communication to reduce context switching and sustain long-term software quality."
      ]
    },
