      "bullets": [
        "Unrestricted WAN exposure of management interfaces and unpatched self-hosted services remain primary homelab initial compromise vectors.",
        "Eliminate direct port forwarding by enforcing Zero Trust overlay networks like Tailscale, WireGuard, or Cloudflare Tunnels for remote management.",
        "Isolate homelab services using VLANs and firewall rules to restrict lateral movement and protect core personal networks upon compromise."
      ]
